                    <h3 class="section-title-color">
                        Must we always teach our children with books? Let them look at the stars and the mountains above. Let them look at the waters and the trees and flowers on Earth. Then they will begin to think, and to think is the beginning of a real education.
                    </h3>
                    <p class="discription">
                        As Headmistress of Our Beginners, preschool under the mentorship of Delhi Public School, Kalyanpur, I draw upon my many years of educational experience, both as an educator and an administrator, and the support of an amazing staff of caring, talented educators, to create a unique educational environment, specially tailored for our youngest scholars.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        For me, engaging young children in enriching educational activities extends beyond the acquisition of standards-based literacy and numeracy skills. Too often today’s educational practice focuses overwhelmingly on student achievement without truly considering the development of children who are healthy, knowledgeable, motivated, and engaged. We need  to create safe and nurturing classrooms that gives parents absolute peace of mind and allows kids to explore their creativity and passion. Young children need repeated experiences observing, exploring, and experimenting within a supportive social context in order to be actively engaged in authentic learning and feel connected to their peers.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        The achievement of our students is built upon the partnership between students, parents, and teachers. Through quality teaching, student support, and our commitment to extra-curricular activities, we create the building blocks for success that will give them an advantage in their later years.  I firmly believe that with our excellent staff, we have the ability to ensure that your child achieves his or her very best.
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        We value the partnership between children’s families and the school in raising children to reach their highest potential. We encourage open communication with parents. Please feel free to contact us with enquiries and questions.
                    </p>


                    <p class="discription">
                        Warmest Regards,
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        <b>Hena Mushtaq </b>
                    </p>
                    <p class="discription">
                        <b>Head Mistress</b>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

